---
title: Lotus Pose Stretch
type: docs
prev: docs/rastyazhka/
---
![вытяжение в позе лотоса](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ef501f65-7f6f-41bf-8719-278093a2f4c6)

{{% steps %}}

### Step 1
Sit on the floor in a comfortable cross-legged position.

### Step 2
Raise both arms overhead and cross your wrists above your head.

### Step 3
Reach up toward the ceiling while dropping your shoulders away from your ears. Gently squeeze your shoulder blades together.

### Step 4
Hold this position for the recommended amount of time (usually 15–30 seconds).

{{% /steps %}}

{{< callout type="info" >}}
• Try to keep the target muscles relaxed during the stretch.

• Breathe slowly and steadily.

• Do not force the stretch—stretch only until you feel comfortable tension, never sharp pain.
{{< /callout >}}
